entries.content:
-玩家进入东方犬舍的时候就会出现这个ui界面
-玩家输入01号专区的时候会出现这个ui界面
界面ui

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>东方犬舍 | 宠爪宠物基地</title>
<style>
    @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Sans+SC:wght@300;400;500;700&display=swap');

    body {
        background-color: #1a1a1a; /* 深邃的炭黑色背景 */
        color: #e0e0e0; /* 柔和的灰白色字体 */
        font-family: 'Noto Sans SC', sans-serif;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 20px;
        line-height: 1.8;
    }

    .kennel-container {
        max-width: 900px;
        margin: 40px auto;
        background-color: #262626; /* 略浅的炭灰色容器背景 */
        border: 1px solid #444; /* 深灰色边框 */
        border-radius: 15px;
        box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5); /* 更深的阴影效果，营造悬浮感 */
        overflow: hidden;
    }

    .kennel-header {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4a3f35, #3a2f25); /* 模拟奢华木质与皮革的渐变色 */
        padding: 30px;
        text-align: center;
        border-bottom: 2px solid #6b5a4b; /* 类似黄铜的边框色 */
    }

    .kennel-header h1 {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 3em;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: #f5e6d3; /* 温暖的米色，如同羊皮纸 */
        text-shadow: 2px 2px 5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
    }

    .kennel-header .subtitle {
        font-size: 1.2em;
        color: #c7b299; /* 稍暗的复古金色 */
        margin-top: 10px;
        font-style: italic;
    }

    .country-section {
        padding: 30px;
        border-bottom: 1px dashed #444; /* 虚线分隔，增加设计感 */
    }

    .country-section:last-child {
        border-bottom: none;
    }

    .country-title {
        font-size: 2.2em;
        font-weight: 500;
        color: #d4bda4; /* 优雅的沙金色 */
        margin-bottom: 25px;
        border-left: 5px solid #8c785d; /* 强调边条 */
        padding-left: 15px;
    }

    .breed-list {
        list-style: none;
        padding-left: 0;
    }

    .breed-item {
        background-color: #333; /* 更深一度的背景，突出条目 */
        border-radius: 10px;
        padding: 20px;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
        transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
    }

    .breed-item:hover {
        transform: translateY(-5px);
        box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
    }

    .breed-name {
        font-size: 1.6em;
        font-weight: 500;
        color: #f5e6d3;
        margin: 0 0 10px 0;
    }

    .breed-name .id-number {
        display: inline-block;
        background-color: #6b5a4b;
        color: #f5e6d3;
        padding: 5px 10px;
        border-radius: 5px;
        font-size: 0.8em;
        margin-right: 15px;
        font-weight: bold;
    }

    .breed-description {
        font-size: 1em;
        color: #b0b0b0; /* 较亮的灰色，易于阅读 */
        padding-left: 55px; /* 对齐编号 */
    }

    .footer {
        background-color: #202020; /* 最深的背景色 */
        padding: 30px;
        text-align: center;
    }

    .footer .contact-title {
        font-size: 1.5em;
        color: #d4bda4;
        margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    .footer .phone-number {
        font-size: 2em;
        font-weight: bold;
        color: #f5e6d3;
        letter-spacing: 2px;
        background-color: #3a2f25;
        padding: 15px 30px;
        border-radius: 50px; /* 椭圆形按钮样式 */
        display: inline-block;
        border: 2px solid #6b5a4b;
        cursor: pointer;
        transition: background-color 0.3s;
    }

    .footer .phone-number:hover {
        background-color: #4a3f35;
    }

</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="kennel-container">
    <div class="kennel-header">
        <h1>🐾 东方犬舍 🐾</h1>
        <p class="subtitle">—— 精选东方血统，献给至尊主人 ——</p>
    </div>

    <!-- 中华区 -->
    <div class="country-section">
        <h2 class="country-title">🇨🇳 华夏犬区</h2>
        <ul class="breed-list">
            <li class="breed-item">
                <h3 class="breed-name"><span class="id-number">#01</span>京畿粉黛犬</h3>
                <p class="breed-description">生于帝都，贵气傲骨，唯有绝对权威方可征服。</p>
            </li>
            <li class="breed-item">
                <h3 class="breed-name"><span class="id-number">#02</span>江南水秀犬</h3>
                <p class="breed-description">气质空灵，柔顺似水，琴棋书画，诗意盎然。</p>
            </li>
            <li class="breed-item">
                <h3 class="breed-name"><span class="id-number">#03</span>巴蜀烈焰犬</h3>
                <p class="breed-description">泼辣直爽，热情如火，野性挑逗，极致刺激。</p>
            </li>
            <li class="breed-item">
                <h3 class="breed-name"><span class="id-number">#04</span>岭南甜芯犬</h3>
                <p class="breed-description">务实精明，温顺机灵，懂得如何恰到好处地取悦主人。</p>
            </li>
        </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- 日本区 -->
    <div class="country-section">
        <h2 class="country-title">🇯🇵 大和犬区</h2>
        <ul class="breed-list">
            <li class="breed-item">
                <h3 class="breed-name"><span class="id-number">#05</span>抚子忠诚犬</h3>
                <p class="breed-description">温柔贤淑，绝对忠诚，完美的居家型伴侣。</p>
            </li>
            <li class="breed-item">
                <h3 class="breed-name"><span class="id-number">#06</span>涩谷风尚犬</h3>
                <p class="breed-description">外表张扬，内心渴望被支配，强烈的反差极具挑战性。</p>
            </li>
            <li class="breed-item">
                <h3 class="breed-name"><span class="id-number">#07</span>秋叶原萌动犬</h3>
                <p class="breed-description">沉浸二次元，可代入任何角色，提供超现实的梦幻体验。</p>
            </li>
        </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- 韩国区 -->
    <div class="country-section">
        <h2 class="country-title">🇰🇷 半岛犬区</h2>
        <ul class="breed-list">
            <li class="breed-item">
                <h3 class="breed-name"><span class="id-number">#08</span>清潭名媛犬</h3>
                <p class="breed-description">气质高冷，出身名流，内心渴望被强大力量折服。</p>
            </li>
            <li class="breed-item">
                <h3 class="breed-name"><span class="id-number">#09</span>遗珠犬</h3>
                <p class="breed-description">前练习生，唱跳俱佳，为获青睐将用尽浑身解数。</p>
            </li>
             <li class="breed-item">
                <h3 class="breed-name"><span class="id-number">#10</span>电竞宝贝犬</h3>
                <p class="breed-description">反应敏捷，思维活跃，彻底的‘格式化’能带来别样快感。</p>
            </li>
        </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- 泰国区 -->
    <div class="country-section">
        <h2 class="country-title">🇹🇭 暹罗犬区</h2>
        <ul class="breed-list">
            <li class="breed-item">
                <h3 class="breed-name"><span class="id-number">#11</span>古法传承犬</h3>
                <p class="breed-description">掌握古老侍奉技艺，带来身心极致的放松与愉悦。</p>
