<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>竞犬场 | 赛事选择</title>
<style>
    @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cinzel+Decorative:wght@700&family=Noto+Sans+SC:wght@300;400;500;700&display=swap');

    body {
        background-color: #1a1a1a;
        color: #e0e0e0;
        font-family: 'Noto Sans SC', sans-serif;
        display: flex;
        justify-content: center;
        align-items: center;
        min-height: 100vh;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 20px;
        box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    .arena-console {
        width: 100%;
        max-width: 900px;
        background: radial-gradient(circle, #2a2a2a, #1a1a1a 80%);
        border: 2px solid #a47d4c; /* 带有金属光泽的古铜色 */
        border-radius: 20px;
        box-shadow: 0 0 40px rgba(164, 125, 76, 0.4), inset 0 0 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.6);
        overflow: hidden;
    }

    .console-header {
        padding: 25px;
        text-align: center;
        background-color: rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
        border-bottom: 2px solid #a47d4c;
    }

    .console-header h1 {
        margin: 0;
        font-family: 'Cinzel Decorative', cursive;
        font-size: 3em;
        color: #f5e1a4; /* 华丽的香槟金色 */
        text-shadow: 0 0 8px #f5e1a4, 0 0 15px rgba(245, 225, 164, 0.5);
    }

    .event-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
        gap: 25px;
        padding: 30px;
    }

    .event-card {
        background: linear-gradient(145deg, #333, #222);
        border-radius: 15px;
        text-align: center;
        padding: 20px;
        cursor: pointer;
        transition: all 0.3s ease;
        position: relative;
        border: 1px solid #555;
    }

    .event-card:hover {
        transform: scale(1.08) rotate(2deg);
        box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.7);
        border-color: #f5e1a4;
    }

    .event-icon {
        font-size: 3.5em;
        margin-bottom: 10px;
        transition: transform 0.3s ease;
    }

    .event-card:hover .event-icon {
        transform: translateY(-5px);
        text-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
    }

    .event-title {
        font-size: 1.4em;
        font-weight: 500;
        color: #dcdcdc;
        margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    .event-tag {
        position: absolute;
        top: 10px;
        left: -8px;
        background-color: #a47d4c;
        color: #1a1a1a;
        padding: 5px 15px;
        font-size: 0.8em;
        font-weight: bold;
        border-radius: 5px;
        transform: rotate(-15deg);
        box-shadow: 2px 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
    }

    .console-footer {
        padding: 15px;
        background-color: rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
        border-top: 1px solid #665239;
        text-align: center;
        font-size: 0.9em;
        color: #888;
        font-style: italic;
    }

</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="arena-console">
    <div class="console-header">
        <h1>🏆 竞犬场 🏆</h1>
    </div>

    <div class="event-grid">
        <!-- 风姿赛区 -->
        <div class="event-card" onclick="selectEvent('S-01')">
            <div class="event-tag">风姿</div>
            <div class="event-icon">💃</div>
            <h2 class="event-title">静态展示赛</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="event-card" onclick="selectEvent('S-02')">
            <div class="event-tag">风姿</div>
            <div class="event-icon">🐾</div>
            <h2 class="event-title">动态仪态赛</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="event-card" onclick="selectEvent('S-03')">
            <div class="event-tag">风姿</div>
            <div class="event-icon">🎭</div>
            <h2 class="event-title">情景扮演赛</h2>
        </div>

        <!-- 侍奉赛区 -->
        <div class="event-card" onclick="selectEvent('SV-01')">
            <div class="event-tag">侍奉</div>
            <div class="event-icon">👄</div>
            <h2 class="event-title">口技展示赛</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="event-card" onclick="selectEvent('SV-02')">
            <div class="event-tag">侍奉</div>
            <div class="event-icon">💧</div>
            <h2 class="event-title">淫水竞速赛</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="event-card" onclick="selectEvent('SV-03')">
            <div class="event-tag">侍奉</div>
            <div class="event-icon">🤝</div>
            <h2 class="event-title">多人侍奉协同赛</h2>
        </div>

        <!-- 血统赛区 -->
        <div class="event-card" onclick="selectEvent('N-01')">
            <div class="event-tag">血统</div>
            <div class="event-icon">👑</div>
            <h2 class="event-title">家世溯源展示</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="event-card" onclick="selectEvent('N-02')">
            <div class="event-tag">血统</div>
            <div class="event-icon">⛓️</div>
            <h2 class="event-title">屈辱忍耐力测试</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="event-card" onclick="selectEvent('N-03')">
            <div class="event-tag">血统</div>
            <div class="event-icon">🔥</div>
            <h2 class="event-title">专属烙印仪式</h2>
        </div>

        <!-- 极限赛区 -->
        <div class="event-card" onclick="selectEvent('E-01')">
            <div class="event-tag">极限</div>
            <div class="event-icon">🥵</div>
            <h2 class="event-title">连续高潮耐力赛</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="event-card" onclick="selectEvent('E-02')">
            <div class="event-tag">极限</div>
            <div class="event-icon">🩸</div>
            <h2 class="event-title">痛苦转化愉悦表演赛</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="event-card" onclick="selectEvent('E-03')">
            <div class="event-tag">极限</div>
            <div class="event-icon">🧬</div>
            <h2 class="event-title">多重改造展示赛</h2>
        </div>

    </div>

    <div class="console-footer">
        请输入赛事编号，以观赏或竞拍该场次的“宠物犬”。
    </div>
</div>
